            "heading": "French Fitness",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "text_transform": true,
            "mobile_title_size": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text_bg9iWf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In 2019, we developed our own brand of home and commercial gym equipment called French Fitness, and currently stand as the brand’s exclusive dealer. </p><p>French Fitness offers an extensive range of products that covers everything you would find in a gym– flooring, treadmills, ellipticals, bikes, accessories, strength training equipment such as selectorized, plate loaded, racks, rigs, weights, and more.</p><p>We pride ourselves for delivering industry-standard quality, excellent customer service, and extensive warranties (10 year parts, 1 year labor). We have a highly accessible 4,400 sq ft. French Fitness showroom in Benicia, CA, which is viewable in person or remotely via video calls. All of our products are assembled in the USA.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_size": "middle"
          }
        },
        "button_mp7fzg": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "See more",
