            "mobile_title_size": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text_yYmt3j": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Marketed at 70% off their retail prices, we carry a long list of industry-trusted brands including Cybex, Precor, Life Fitness, Technogym, Matrix, Stairmaster, Star Trac, Woodway, and more. The equipment is taken from commercial fitness facilities that are upgrading or are closing their doors. We then remanufacture them to like-new condition. All remanufactured equipment includes a 1 year parts and labor warranty, along with extended warranty options of up to 5 years parts and labor (longer than brand new equipment warranty), to show confidence in the equipment we sell.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_size": "middle"
          }
        },
