        "block_bjUD63": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/compressed_d178dd022b90f702256f3feeb3e1157c.webp",
            "title": "Accessible Showroom & Warehouse",
            "text": "<p>We invite our clients to visit our showroom and warehouse to witness our quality control and equipment testing processes firsthand. This transparency allows potential customers to inspect our gym equipment before making a purchase, ensuring they are fully confident in their investment. Our accessible showroom and warehouse are a testament to our commitment to openness and customer trust.</p><p><strong>Fitness Superstore, Inc.</strong></p><p>This is where our factory, assembly line, and office are located for all the brands we carry.</p><p>[[point]] 537 Stone Rd Suite F Benicia, CA 94510</p><p><strong>French Fitness HQ</strong></p><p>The 40,000 sq ft warehouse includes our 4,400 sq ft French Fitness warehouse showroom.</p><p>[[point]] 457 Industrial Way Benicia CA 94510</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
